#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Custom configuration example {#custom-configuration-example}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Here's how you might configure Iskay with different settings:\n"
msgstr ""

